From dad9d15851a569f0b2650cf12dbb07521b286c4c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 23:27:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add a file-backed V2 monetary snapshot and undo log

Persist EncodeMonetaryState beside the UTXO snapshot as a versioned
checksummed monetary.dat plus one undo record per commit. Reopen returns
the same bytes. Undo restores the previous monetary bytes and state root.
A truncated record fails closed and does not publish a root. This rename
is not atomic with the UTXO snapshot, lotusd does not call this store,
and no V2 block is accepted.
